Subject: Re: Modification indices: when are they "NA", and what to if suggested path makes model non-recursive?
Message-ID: <PmqiWVULA-A.dO3aSm45DgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <PmqiWVULA-A.-SIpxUYkDgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
